msgid "PES transformations"
msgstr "势能面变换"

msgid ""
"Once a potential energy surface (PES) has been generated by the ``XSURF`` "
"program, it can be transformed to different representations. The first "
"possibility (`analytical representations (POLY) "
"<pes_transformations.html#analytical-representations-poly>`__) is a "
"representation by basis functions, i.e. the ``POLY`` program. The "
"``PESTRANS`` program (`transformation of the coordinate system (PESTRANS) "
"<pes_transformations.html#transformation-of-the-coordinate-system-"
"pestrans>`__) offers a transformation of the PES for vibrational structure "
"calculations of isotopologues or Franck-Condon factors."
msgstr ""
"一旦势能面（PES）由 ``XSURF`` 程序生成，它可以被变换为不同的表示形式。第一种可能性（\\ `解析表示（POLY） "
"<pes_transformations.html#analytical-representations-poly>`__\\ "
"）是通过基函数进行表示，即 ``POLY`` 程序。\\ ``PESTRANS`` 程序（\\ `坐标系变换（PESTRANS） "
"<pes_transformations.html#transformation-of-the-coordinate-system-"
"pestrans>`__\\ ）提供了对势能面的变换，用于同位素体或弗兰克-康登因子的振动结构计算。"

msgid "Analytical representations (POLY)"
msgstr "解析表示（POLY）"

msgid ""
"The ``POLY`` program allows for the transformation of the potential energy "
"surface and property surfaces from a grid representation to an analytical "
"representation by polynomials, Gaussians or B-splines. <!--Once the PES "
"calculation has been started from a transition state, this must be specified"
" explictly by the ``SADDLE`` keyword.-->"
msgstr ""
"``POLY`` 程序允许将势能面和性质曲面从网格表示转换为通过多项式、高斯函数或B样条表示的解析表示。<!–一旦势能面计算从过渡态开始，必须通过 "
"``SADDLE`` 关键字明确指定。–>"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Record handling"
msgstr "记录处理"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive allows to specify explicitly, from where the grid "
"information shall be taken and where it shall be stored to disk. This can "
"also be accomplished in an automated manner, which is recommended. These "
"features are only relevant for the simulation of vibronic spectra as one has"
" to deal with several PESs in the same input. For simple VCI calculations, "
"no information is needed here."
msgstr ""
"``DISK`` "
"指令允许明确指定从何处读取网格信息以及将其存储到磁盘的何处。这也可以通过自动方式完成，推荐使用自动方式。这些功能仅与模拟振动光谱相关，因为需要在同一输入中处理多个势能面。对于简单的"
" VCI 计算，此处不需要任何信息。"

msgid "Fit Functions"
msgstr "拟合函数"

msgid ""
"A fit function has to be defined for each coordinate. These fit functions "
"are used to transform an grid representation of a surface generated by the "
"``XSURF`` program to an analytical representation. If no fit functions are "
"given, the fit functions used in the ``XSURF`` program for the intermediate "
"fitting are used. This directive also exists in the ``XSURF`` program. If no"
" fit functions are defined within the ``XSURF`` program, but in the ``POLY``"
" program, the fit functions of the ``POLY`` program are also used in the "
"``XSURF`` program."
msgstr ""
"必须为每个坐标定义一个拟合函数。这些拟合函数用于将由 ``XSURF`` 程序生成的势能面的网格表示转换为解析表示。如果未给出拟合函数，则使用 "
"``XSURF`` 程序中用于中间拟合的拟合函数。该指令也存在于 ``XSURF`` 程序中。如果在 ``XSURF`` 程序内未定义拟合函数，但在 "
"``POLY`` 程序中定义了，则 ``POLY`` 程序的拟合函数也会在 ``XSURF`` 程序中使用。"

msgid "Scaling factors"
msgstr "标度因子"

msgid ""
"The 1D potential functions can be scaled by user-defined factors. This "
"allows to fit potentials to experimentally determined frequencies."
msgstr "一维势函数可以通过用户定义的因子进行标度。这允许将势函数拟合到实验确定的频率。"

msgid "The following example shows the scaling of the three modes of water."
msgstr "以下示例展示了水的三个模式的标度。"

msgid "Internal Coordinates"
msgstr "内坐标"

msgid "Transformation of the coordinate system (PESTRANS)"
msgstr "坐标系变换 (PESTRANS)"

msgid ""
"The ``PESTRANS`` program allows to change the coordinate system being used "
"within the representation of the potential by a Duschinsky-like "
"transformation. This allows for the transformation of PESs as needed for the"
" calculation of the vibrational spectra of isotopologues or Franck-Condon "
"factors including Duschinsky rotations. This requires a representation of "
"the potential energy surface by polynomials. Different versions of the "
"``PESTRANS`` program will be used in combination with the ``XSURF`` program."
" For further details see:"
msgstr ""
"``PESTRANS`` "
"程序允许通过杜辛斯基类变换来改变势能表示中所使用的坐标系。这使得能够变换势能面，以满足计算同位素体的振动光谱或包含杜辛斯基旋转的弗兰克-"
"康登因子的需要。这要求势能面由多项式表示。不同版本的 ``PESTRANS`` 程序将与 ``XSURF`` 程序结合使用。更多细节请参阅："

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=QFF`` transforms an n-mode expansion of the PES into a quartic "
"force field (QFF)."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=QFF`` 将 PES 的 n 模展开转换为四次力场（QFF）。"

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=ISO`` indicates a transformation of the spanning axes of the PES"
" for the calculation of isotopologues."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=ISO`` 表示对 PES 的生成轴进行变换，用于计算同位素变体。"

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=FCF`` performs a Duschinsky transformation as needed for the "
"calculation of Franck-Condon factors."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=FCF`` 执行 Duschinsky 变换，用于计算弗兰克-康登因子。"

msgid ""
"Most options and directives of the ``XSURF`` program can also be used in the"
" ``PESTRANS`` program (i.e. ``INFO``, ``INTENSITY``, ``SCALNM``, ``DISK``, "
"``LINCOMB``, ``VTAYLOR``), while specific ones had to be excluded (i.e. "
"``NGRID``, etc. )."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的大多数选项和指令也可以在 ``PESTRANS`` 程序中使用（例如 ``INFO``\\ 、\\ "
"``INTENSITY``\\ 、\\ ``SCALNM``\\ 、\\ ``DISK``\\ 、\\ ``LINCOMB``\\ 、\\ "
"``VTAYLOR``\\ ），而某些特定指令则被排除在外（例如 ``NGRID`` 等）。"

msgid "Definition of atomic masses"
msgstr "原子质量的定义"

msgid ""
"Once the ``PESTRANS`` program will be used for the calculation of "
"isotopologues, the atomic masses of the individual atoms can be specified by"
" this directive. Note, the use of the ``MASS`` directive here differs from "
"that in the electronic structure code as it requests the running number of "
"the atoms in the geometry definition."
msgstr ""
"当 ``PESTRANS`` 程序将用于计算同位素体时，可以通过此指令指定各个原子的原子质量。请注意，此处 ``MASS`` "
"指令的用法与电子结构代码中的不同，因为它要求的是几何定义中原子的运行编号。"

msgid "Restart capabilities"
msgstr "重启功能"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive essentially is the same as in the ``XSURF`` program, "
"i.e. a transformed surface can be dumped or a restart can be performed from "
"an external file."
msgstr "``DISK`` 指令本质上与 ``XSURF`` 程序中的相同，即可以转储变换后的势能面，或者可以从外部文件执行重启。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a standard calculation for water, the VSCF and "
"VCI calculations after the call of the ``PESTRANS`` program refer a to "
"doubly deuterated water."
msgstr "以下示例展示了水的标准计算，在调用 ``PESTRANS`` 程序后进行的 VSCF 和 VCI 计算参考了双氘代水。"
